{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e18-scene-16",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "策划公益节目挽回声誉  (Pitching Charity Specials to Restore Trust)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "wen_simo": "闻思默"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Before Bu Xiaogu even leaves the studio corridor, Xingzi rushes up to pitch Wen Simo a public-relations plan to repair the damage from the fraudulent commercial. Listen to the three of them in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，你来干吗呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我有事找闻老师帮忙啊，怎么了，只许你来不许我来啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你又有什么事？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "是闻娱论虚假广告的事，大范围的网络攻击已经控制住了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "但这次受害人主要是老人和残疾人，社会影响还是很不好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们总编室想到了一套危机公关方案，打算策划一系列公益节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "给受害人提供慈善服务，关注弱势群体，挽回节目的品牌价值。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "我觉得非常好，这主意不错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "您同意了？那走走走，咱们赶快策划一下！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "闻老师，还有刚才引荐的事，您千万别忘了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "二位，魔鬼鱼现在不在位，怎么我这个王老五倒成了大忙人了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你俩让我帮忙可以，咱能不能一个一个来？我马上要去约会了，明天再说！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，你来干吗呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sister Xingzi, what are you doing here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我有事找闻老师帮忙啊，怎么了，只许你来不许我来啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I came to ask Mr Wen for help too—what, are only you allowed to come and not me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你又有什么事？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And what business have you got this time?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "是闻娱论虚假广告的事，大范围的网络攻击已经控制住了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is about the false ad on your show; the widespread online attacks are now under control.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "但这次受害人主要是老人和残疾人，社会影响还是很不好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'However, because the victims were mainly seniors and disabled people, the public impact remains bad.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们总编室想到了一套危机公关方案，打算策划一系列公益节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our editorial office devised a crisis PR plan to produce a series of public-interest specials.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "给受害人提供慈善服务，关注弱势群体，挽回节目的品牌价值。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We will offer charity aid to victims, spotlight vulnerable groups, and restore the show's brand value.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "我觉得非常好，这主意不错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I think that is wonderful; it is a solid idea.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "您同意了？那走走走，咱们赶快策划一下！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You agree? Then come on, let us go map it out right away!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "闻老师，还有刚才引荐的事，您千万别忘了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Wen, please do not forget about the director's introduction just now either!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "二位，魔鬼鱼现在不在位，怎么我这个王老五倒成了大忙人了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ladies, now that Manta Ray is out of office, how did a bachelor like me become the busiest man around?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你俩让我帮忙可以，咱能不能一个一个来？我马上要去约会了，明天再说！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Helping you both is fine, yet can we take turns one by one? I have a date right now, so let us talk tomorrow!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，你来干吗呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我有事找闻老师帮忙啊，怎么了，只许你来不许我来啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你又有什么事？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "是闻娱论虚假广告的事，大范围的网络攻击已经控制住了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "但这次受害人主要是老人和残疾人，社会影响还是很不好。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们总编室想到了一套危机公关方案，打算策划一系列公益节目。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "给受害人提供慈善服务，关注弱势群体，挽回节目的品牌价值。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "我觉得非常好，这主意不错。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "您同意了？那走走走，咱们赶快策划一下！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "闻老师，还有刚才引荐的事，您千万别忘了！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "二位，魔鬼鱼现在不在位，怎么我这个王老五倒成了大忙人了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你俩让我帮忙可以，咱能不能一个一个来？我马上要去约会了，明天再说！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Approving the charity specials right away, Wen Simo begs the two relentless producers to line up one at a time so he is not late for his date. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
